# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Vendored upstream executables — never commit third-party binaries.
# Each demo expects you to drop the upstream tool's binary in its folder
# locally, but those binaries belong to their respective authors.
*.exe
*.dll
*.dylib
*.so

# ScripTree per-user configuration sidecars — local-only by design,
# never committed (they hold per-user paths and preferences).
*.configs.json
*.treeconfigs.json
